{"meta":{"nbResults":51},"repertoires":{"1440":{"id":1440,"title":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/100-dni-misja-zeus-2026-09-26-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786615066.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":106,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-13 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":106}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":494,"name":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(13 LAT, 110 MIN) Kontynuacja jednego z najg\u0142o\u015bniejszych m\u0142odzie\u017cowych film\u00f3w ostatnich lat. Tym razem bohaterowie wychodz\u0105 poza szkolne mury, a stawka jest wi\u0119ksza ni\u017c kiedykolwiek wcze\u015bniej - cho\u0107 oni sami nie czuj\u0105 si\u0119 na ni\u0105 gotowi. Kapsel i jego ekipa stawiaj\u0105 pierwsze kroki w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu. Jedni ruszyli ju\u017c dalej, inni pr\u00f3buj\u0105 pouk\u0142ada\u0107 \u017cycie po swojemu, a Kapsel\u2026 nie potrafi si\u0119 odnale\u017a\u0107. Mieszka z rodzicami, w pracy po\u017cegna\u0142 si\u0119 z ambicjami i coraz cz\u0119\u015bciej zadaje sobie pytanie, czy najlepszy czas ma za sob\u0105. Kiedy jednak na horyzoncie pojawia si\u0119 misja, od kt\u00f3rej mo\u017ce zale\u017ce\u0107 przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 wielu ludzi, nie ma czasu na w\u0105tpliwo\u015bci.<\/span>","oryginal_title":" 100 dni: Misja Zeus","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Miko\u0142aj Piszczan","organizer":"Polska","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"3","duration":110,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786615066.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1443":{"id":1443,"title":"NIEBO NAD NORMANDI\u0104  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/niebo-nad-normandia-2026-09-26-16-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786615447.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T16:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 15:15:00","startAt":"2026-08-13 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 16:15:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":495,"name":"NIEBO NAD NORMANDI\u0104  ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(15 LAT, 100 MIN) 72 godziny przed l\u0105dowaniem w Normandii, losy \u015bwiata maj\u0105 zale\u017ce\u0107 od... pogody. Wojna to nie tylko bitwy, to w szczeg\u00f3lno\u015bci strategie i decyzje, kt\u00f3rych skutki odczu\u0107 mog\u0105 miliony. Pracuj\u0105cy dla brytyjskiej armii meteorolog <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/James+Stagg-2869814\" title=\"James Stagg\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">James Stagg<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Andrew+Scott-61258\" title=\"Andrew Scott\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Andrew Scott<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">) musi podj\u0105\u0107 najwa\u017cniejsz\u0105 decyzj\u0119 w swojej karierze \u2013 prognoza, kt\u00f3r\u0105 przedstawi, mo\u017ce przes\u0105dzi\u0107 o sukcesie lub kl\u0119sce najwi\u0119kszej operacji wojskowej w historii. Zamkni\u0119ty w atmosferze nieufno\u015bci i presji ze strony najwy\u017cszych dow\u00f3dc\u00f3w, Stagg toczy psychologiczn\u0105 walk\u0119 z czasem, wspierany jedynie przez kapitan <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kay+Summersby-393342\" title=\"Kay Summersby\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kay Summersby<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kerry+Condon-136125\" title=\"Kerry Condon\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kerry Condon<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">). Nad wszystkim czuwa genera\u0142 <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Dwight+D.+Eisenhower-210712\" title=\"Dwight D. Eisenhower\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Dwight D. Eisenhower<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Brendan+Fraser-5137\" title=\"Brendan Fraser\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Brendan Fraser<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), kt\u00f3ry musi zdecydowa\u0107 czy ruszy\u0107 z inwazj\u0105, czy j\u0105 op\u00f3\u017ani\u0107 \u2013 ryzykuj\u0105c, \u017ce Niemcy odkryj\u0105 plany aliant\u00f3w.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Pressure","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Anthony Maras","organizer":"Francja, USA, Wielka Brytania","country":"Francja, USA, Wielka Brytania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"3","duration":100,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786615447.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1447":{"id":1447,"title":"TONY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tony-2026-09-26-18-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786616268.jpg","date":"2026-09-26T18:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-26 17:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-13 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-26 18:30:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":496,"name":"TONY ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(15 LAT, 106 MIN) Anthony Bourdain \u2013 buntownik, outsider, g\u0142os pokolenia, jeden z najbardziej znanych szef\u00f3w kuchni i jedna z najwi\u0119kszych, najbardziej charyzmatycznych osobowo\u015bci telewizyjnych. Podr\u00f3\u017cnik, pisarz, odkrywca, kt\u00f3rego miliony ludzi na ca\u0142ym \u015bwiecie pokocha\u0142y za bezkompromisowy styl, mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 do \u017cycia, szacunek do ludzi, odwag\u0119, ciekawo\u015b\u0107 \u015bwiata i autentyczno\u015b\u0107. \"<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/film\/Tony-2026-10079933\" title=\"Tony\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Tony<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\" to historia pocz\u0105tk\u00f3w jego drogi \u2013 kim by\u0142, zanim sta\u0142 si\u0119 Anthonym Bourdainem.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Upalne lato 1976 roku, Provincetown \u2013 miasto pulsuj\u0105ce wolno\u015bci\u0105, seksem i energi\u0105. M\u0142ody, marz\u0105cy o karierze pisarza, Tony (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Dominic+Sessa-3051113\" title=\"Dominic Sessa\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Dominic Sessa<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), by podreperowa\u0107 bud\u017cet, trafia na zmywak do restauracji serwuj\u0105cej owoce morza, prowadzonej przez tajemniczego szefa kuchni (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Antonio+Banderas-133\" title=\"Antonio Banderas\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Antonio Banderas<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">). W intensywnej, chaotycznej, a jednocze\u015bnie niezwykle kreatywnej atmosferze Tony odkrywa swoj\u0105 pasj\u0119, powo\u0142anie i to, kim tak naprawd\u0119 jest.<\/span>","oryginal_title":" Tony","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Matt Johnson","organizer":"USA","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"3","duration":106,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786616268.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1445":{"id":1445,"title":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/100-dni-misja-zeus-2026-09-27-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786615066.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":119,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-13 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"