Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Andrew Scott<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">) musi podj\u0105\u0107 najwa\u017cniejsz\u0105 decyzj\u0119 w swojej karierze \u2013 prognoza, kt\u00f3r\u0105 przedstawi, mo\u017ce przes\u0105dzi\u0107 o sukcesie lub kl\u0119sce najwi\u0119kszej operacji wojskowej w historii. Zamkni\u0119ty w atmosferze nieufno\u015bci i presji ze strony najwy\u017cszych dow\u00f3dc\u00f3w, Stagg toczy psychologiczn\u0105 walk\u0119 z czasem, wspierany jedynie przez kapitan <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kay+Summersby-393342\" title=\"Kay Summersby\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kay Summersby<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kerry+Condon-136125\" title=\"Kerry Condon\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kerry Condon<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">). Nad wszystkim czuwa genera\u0142 <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Dwight+D.+Eisenhower-210712\" title=\"Dwight D. Eisenhower\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Dwight D. Eisenhower<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Brendan+Fraser-5137\" title=\"Brendan Fraser\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Brendan Fraser<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), kt\u00f3ry musi zdecydowa\u0107 czy ruszy\u0107 z inwazj\u0105, czy j\u0105 op\u00f3\u017ani\u0107 \u2013 ryzykuj\u0105c, \u017ce Niemcy odkryj\u0105 plany aliant\u00f3w.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Pressure","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Anthony Maras","organizer":"Francja, USA, Wielka Brytania","country":"Francja, USA, Wielka Brytania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"3","duration":100,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786615447.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1448":{"id":1448,"title":"TONY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tony-2026-09-27-18-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786616268.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T18:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 17:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-13 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 18:30:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":496,"name":"TONY ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(15 LAT, 106 MIN) Anthony Bourdain \u2013 buntownik, outsider, g\u0142os pokolenia, jeden z najbardziej znanych szef\u00f3w kuchni i jedna z najwi\u0119kszych, najbardziej charyzmatycznych osobowo\u015bci telewizyjnych. Podr\u00f3\u017cnik, pisarz, odkrywca, kt\u00f3rego miliony ludzi na ca\u0142ym \u015bwiecie pokocha\u0142y za bezkompromisowy styl, mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 do \u017cycia, szacunek do ludzi, odwag\u0119, ciekawo\u015b\u0107 \u015bwiata i autentyczno\u015b\u0107. \"<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/film\/Tony-2026-10079933\" title=\"Tony\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Tony<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\" to historia pocz\u0105tk\u00f3w jego drogi \u2013 kim by\u0142, zanim sta\u0142 si\u0119 Anthonym Bourdainem.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Upalne lato 1976 roku, Provincetown \u2013 miasto pulsuj\u0105ce wolno\u015bci\u0105, seksem i energi\u0105. M\u0142ody, marz\u0105cy o karierze pisarza, Tony (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Dominic+Sessa-3051113\" title=\"Dominic Sessa\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Dominic Sessa<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), by podreperowa\u0107 bud\u017cet, trafia na zmywak do restauracji serwuj\u0105cej owoce morza, prowadzonej przez tajemniczego szefa kuchni (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Antonio+Banderas-133\" title=\"Antonio Banderas\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Antonio Banderas<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">). W intensywnej, chaotycznej, a jednocze\u015bnie niezwykle kreatywnej atmosferze Tony odkrywa swoj\u0105 pasj\u0119, powo\u0142anie i to, kim tak naprawd\u0119 jest.<\/span>","oryginal_title":" Tony","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Matt Johnson","organizer":"USA","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"3","duration":106,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1786616268.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1466":{"id":1466,"title":"MARSUPILAMI ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-2026-10-02-15-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789632361.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T15:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 14:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 10:07:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 15:15:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":502,"name":"MARSUPILAMI ","description":"(5 LAT, 99 MIN)   Podczas rejsu all-inclusive David, Tess i ich synek odkrywaj\u0105 w swoim baga\u017cu uroczego, \u017c\u00f3\u0142tego stworka w czarne c\u0119tki, kt\u00f3rego niewyobra\u017calni d\u0142ugi ogon i nieposkromiony temperament w mgnieniu oka zamieniaj\u0105 rodzinne wakacje w totalny chaos - zw\u0142aszcza gdy okazuje si\u0119, \u017ce nowego przyjaciela ch\u0142opca pr\u00f3buje odnale\u017a\u0107 zdecydowanie zbyt wiele os\u00f3b.","oryginal_title":"Marsupilami","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"familijny\/komedia\/przygodowy","director":"Philippe Lacheau","organizer":"Francja\/Belgia","country":"Francja\/Belgia","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":99,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789632361.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1478":{"id":1478,"title":"BEZ KO\u0143CA (2D, NAPISY PL) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/bez-konca-2d-napisy-pl-2026-10-02-17-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789639302.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T17:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 12:15:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 17:15:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":506,"name":"BEZ KO\u0143CA (2D, NAPISY PL) ","description":"(15 LAT, 105 MIN)   Daniel nie s\u0142ysza\u0142, jak jego szesnastoletni syn Krzysztof wychodzi nad ranem z domu. Nie wiedzia\u0142, co zaci\u0105gn\u0119\u0142o ch\u0142opaka na most nad Wis\u0142\u0105 - wiedzia\u0142 tylko, \u017ce to tam widziano go po raz ostatni. Kamera CCTV uchwyci\u0142a go, a potem, mi\u0119dzy jednym jej obrotem a drugim, Krzysiek znikn\u0105\u0142. Mo\u017cliwo\u015bci s\u0105 dwie: albo skoczy\u0142 do rzeki, albo ukradkiem zszed\u0142 z mostu. Od tamtej pory Daniel i jego \u017cona Agnieszka \u017cyj\u0105 w stanie zawieszenia: mi\u0119dzy rozpaczliw\u0105 nadziej\u0105 a parali\u017cuj\u0105cym strachem. Daniel nie potrafi biernie czeka\u0107 na coraz mniej prawdopodobny prze\u0142om w policyjnym \u015bledztwie, buduje wi\u0119c \u0142\u00f3d\u017a wyposa\u017con\u0105 w kamery i drony z zamiarem samodzielnego zbadania mrocznych g\u0142\u0119bin rzeki. To pocz\u0105tek poszukiwa\u0144, kt\u00f3re poch\u0142on\u0105 go w ca\u0142o\u015bci. Dzie\u0144 po dniu przeczesuje Wis\u0142\u0119, nieustannie rozwijaj\u0105c nowe narz\u0119dzia i techniki poszukiwawcze. Zaczynaj\u0105 odzywa\u0107 si\u0119 do niego inne rodziny uwi\u0119zione w tej samej otch\u0142ani niepewno\u015bci i bez ko\u0144ca poszukuj\u0105ce odpowiedzi. D\u0142ugie, samotne godziny sp\u0119dzone na \u0142odzi staj\u0105 si\u0119 dla Daniela szans\u0105 na rozliczenie z \u017cyciem sprzed znikni\u0119cia Krzysztofa. Wraz z mijaniem kolejnych miesi\u0119cy jego b\u00f3l tylko si\u0119 pog\u0142\u0119bia; ojciec zmaga si\u0119 z ci\u0105g\u0142ym napi\u0119ciem mi\u0119dzy nies\u0142abn\u0105cym p\u0119dem do dalszych poszukiwa\u0144 a bolesn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105, w kt\u00f3rej nieodwracalna strata odmieni jego \u017cycie raz na zawsze.","oryginal_title":"BEZ KO\u0143CA","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"\tMicha\u0142 Marczak","organizer":"Polska","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":105,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789639302.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1450":{"id":1450,"title":"MISTYCZKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mistyczka-2026-10-02-19-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789628597.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T19:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":114,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 18:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 09:07:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 19:15:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":114}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":497,"name":"MISTYCZKA ","description":"(13 LAT, 90 MIN)   Przez lata Alicja Lenczewska prowadzi\u0142a dynamiczne \u017cycie. By\u0142a wiernym cz\u0142onkiem partii komunistycznej i cenion\u0105 nauczycielk\u0105 \u2013 wymagaj\u0105c\u0105, odpowiedzialn\u0105 i ca\u0142kowicie oddan\u0105 swojej pracy. Uwielbia\u0142a zagraniczne podr\u00f3\u017ce. Wydawa\u0142o si\u0119, \u017ce jej przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 zosta\u0142a ju\u017c dawno napisana. A\u017c do dnia, w kt\u00f3rym jedno spotkanie odmieni\u0142o wszystko... Wbrew sceptycyzmowi otoczenia i w\u0142asnym l\u0119kom Alicja wkracza na \u015bcie\u017ck\u0119 g\u0142\u0119bokiego \u017cycia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci, z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.","oryginal_title":"MISTYCZKA","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat\/obyczajowy","director":"Jan Sobierajski","organizer":"Polska","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789628597.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1467":{"id":1467,"title":"MARSUPILAMI ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-2026-10-03-15-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789632361.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T15:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 14:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 10:07:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 15:15:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":502,"name":"MARSUPILAMI ","description":"(5 LAT, 99 MIN)   Podczas rejsu all-inclusive David, Tess i ich synek odkrywaj\u0105 w swoim baga\u017cu uroczego, \u017c\u00f3\u0142tego stworka w czarne c\u0119tki, kt\u00f3rego niewyobra\u017calni d\u0142ugi ogon i nieposkromiony temperament w mgnieniu oka zamieniaj\u0105 rodzinne wakacje w totalny chaos - zw\u0142aszcza gdy okazuje si\u0119, \u017ce nowego przyjaciela ch\u0142opca pr\u00f3buje odnale\u017a\u0107 zdecydowanie zbyt wiele os\u00f3b.","oryginal_title":"Marsupilami","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"familijny\/komedia\/przygodowy","director":"Philippe Lacheau","organizer":"Francja\/Belgia","country":"Francja\/Belgia","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":99,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789632361.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1479":{"id":1479,"title":"BEZ KO\u0143CA (2D, NAPISY PL) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/bez-konca-2d-napisy-pl-2026-10-03-17-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789639302.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T17:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 16:15:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 12:15:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 17:15:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":506,"name":"BEZ KO\u0143CA (2D, NAPISY PL) ","description":"(15 LAT, 105 MIN)   Daniel nie s\u0142ysza\u0142, jak jego szesnastoletni syn Krzysztof wychodzi nad ranem z domu. Nie wiedzia\u0142, co zaci\u0105gn\u0119\u0142o ch\u0142opaka na most nad Wis\u0142\u0105 - wiedzia\u0142 tylko, \u017ce to tam widziano go po raz ostatni. Kamera CCTV uchwyci\u0142a go, a potem, mi\u0119dzy jednym jej obrotem a drugim, Krzysiek znikn\u0105\u0142. Mo\u017cliwo\u015bci s\u0105 dwie: albo skoczy\u0142 do rzeki, albo ukradkiem zszed\u0142 z mostu. Od tamtej pory Daniel i jego \u017cona Agnieszka \u017cyj\u0105 w stanie zawieszenia: mi\u0119dzy rozpaczliw\u0105 nadziej\u0105 a parali\u017cuj\u0105cym strachem. Daniel nie potrafi biernie czeka\u0107 na coraz mniej prawdopodobny prze\u0142om w policyjnym \u015bledztwie, buduje wi\u0119c \u0142\u00f3d\u017a wyposa\u017con\u0105 w kamery i drony z zamiarem samodzielnego zbadania mrocznych g\u0142\u0119bin rzeki. To pocz\u0105tek poszukiwa\u0144, kt\u00f3re poch\u0142on\u0105 go w ca\u0142o\u015bci. Dzie\u0144 po dniu przeczesuje Wis\u0142\u0119, nieustannie rozwijaj\u0105c nowe narz\u0119dzia i techniki poszukiwawcze. Zaczynaj\u0105 odzywa\u0107 si\u0119 do niego inne rodziny uwi\u0119zione w tej samej otch\u0142ani niepewno\u015bci i bez ko\u0144ca poszukuj\u0105ce odpowiedzi. D\u0142ugie, samotne godziny sp\u0119dzone na \u0142odzi staj\u0105 si\u0119 dla Daniela szans\u0105 na rozliczenie z \u017cyciem sprzed znikni\u0119cia Krzysztofa. Wraz z mijaniem kolejnych miesi\u0119cy jego b\u00f3l tylko si\u0119 pog\u0142\u0119bia; ojciec zmaga si\u0119 z ci\u0105g\u0142ym napi\u0119ciem mi\u0119dzy nies\u0142abn\u0105cym p\u0119dem do dalszych poszukiwa\u0144 a bolesn\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105, w kt\u00f3rej nieodwracalna strata odmieni jego \u017cycie raz na zawsze.","oryginal_title":"BEZ KO\u0143CA","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"\tMicha\u0142 Marczak","organizer":"Polska","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":105,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789639302.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"B