cia duchowego. Jej mistyczne zapiski pe\u0142ne szczero\u015bci, nadziei i m\u0105dro\u015bci, z czasem trafiaj\u0105 do tysi\u0119cy ludzi szukaj\u0105cych odpowiedzi na najwa\u017cniejsze pytania o mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, cierpienie, wiar\u0119 i sens \u017cycia.","oryginal_title":"MISTYCZKA","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat\/obyczajowy","director":"Jan Sobierajski","organizer":"Polska","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789628597.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1469":{"id":1469,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-10-09-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789632753.jpg","date":"2026-10-09T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-09 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 10:14:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-09 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":503,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"(7 LAT, 90 MIN)   Jedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.","oryginal_title":"Girl in the Clouds","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"\tanimowany\/fantasy","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"Francja\/Belgia","country":"Francja\/Belgia","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789632753.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1481":{"id":1481,"title":"SPA WEEKEND (2D, NAPISY PL) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/spa-weekend-2d-napisy-pl-2026-10-09-16-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789642061.jpg","date":"2026-10-09T16:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-09 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 12:48:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-09 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":507,"name":"SPA WEEKEND (2D, NAPISY PL) ","description":"(13 LAT, 97 MIN)   Jane, Coco i Sophie - przyjaci\u00f3\u0142ki z dzieci\u0144stwa - wyje\u017cd\u017caj\u0105 na ekskluzywny spa break do Palm Springs. Ma by\u0107 cisza, regeneracja i luksusowe zabiegi. Wszystko idzie zgodnie z planem do momentu, gdy na miejscu pojawia si\u0119 ich dawna przyjaci\u00f3\u0142ka Mel - chodz\u0105ca katastrofa. Od tej chwili relaks zmienia si\u0119 w seri\u0119 kompromituj\u0105cych sytuacji, nieoczekiwanych wyzna\u0144 i zbyt spontanicznych decyzji. Brzmi jak wymarzony wyjazd? Poczekajcie do pierwszego drinka.","oryginal_title":"Spa Weekend","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"Komedia","director":"Jon Lucas, Scott Moore","organizer":"USA","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":97,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789642061.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1453":{"id":1453,"title":"OBCY (2D, NAPISY PL) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2d-napisy-pl-2026-10-09-18-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789629452.jpg","date":"2026-10-09T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-09 17:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 09:19:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-09 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":498,"name":"OBCY (2D, NAPISY PL) ","description":"(15 LAT, 122 MIN)   \"Obcy\" to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa, opublikowanej w 1942 roku.<br><br>Fran\u00e7ois Ozon opowiada histori\u0119 Meursaulta, skromnego, niepozornego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Do czasu, gdy pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia. Adaptacja Ozona, kt\u00f3ra mia\u0142a premier\u0119 w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji, to niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony. Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, stanowi\u0105ce ho\u0142d dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu. W rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych Benjamin Voisin (\"Stracone z\u0142udzenia\", \"Lato \u201885\") oraz Rebecca Marder (\"Moja zbrodnia\").","oryginal_title":"\tL'Etranger","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat","director":"Francois Ozon","organizer":"Francja","country":"Francja","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":122,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789629452.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1470":{"id":1470,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-10-10-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789632753.jpg","date":"2026-10-10T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-10 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 10:14:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-10 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":503,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"(7 LAT, 90 MIN)   Jedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.","oryginal_title":"Girl in the Clouds","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"\tanimowany\/fantasy","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"Francja\/Belgia","country":"Francja\/Belgia","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789632753.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1482":{"id":1482,"title":"SPA WEEKEND (2D, NAPISY PL) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/spa-weekend-2d-napisy-pl-2026-10-10-16-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789642061.jpg","date":"2026-10-10T16:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-10 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 12:48:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-10 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":507,"name":"SPA WEEKEND (2D, NAPISY PL) ","description":"(13 LAT, 97 MIN)   Jane, Coco i Sophie - przyjaci\u00f3\u0142ki z dzieci\u0144stwa - wyje\u017cd\u017caj\u0105 na ekskluzywny spa break do Palm Springs. Ma by\u0107 cisza, regeneracja i luksusowe zabiegi. Wszystko idzie zgodnie z planem do momentu, gdy na miejscu pojawia si\u0119 ich dawna przyjaci\u00f3\u0142ka Mel - chod