 dawna przyjaci\u00f3\u0142ka Mel - chodz\u0105ca katastrofa. Od tej chwili relaks zmienia si\u0119 w seri\u0119 kompromituj\u0105cych sytuacji, nieoczekiwanych wyzna\u0144 i zbyt spontanicznych decyzji. Brzmi jak wymarzony wyjazd? Poczekajcie do pierwszego drinka.","oryginal_title":"Spa Weekend","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"Komedia","director":"Jon Lucas, Scott Moore","organizer":"USA","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":97,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789642061.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1455":{"id":1455,"title":"OBCY (2D, NAPISY PL) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/obcy-2d-napisy-pl-2026-10-11-18-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789629452.jpg","date":"2026-10-11T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-11 17:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 09:19:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-11 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":498,"name":"OBCY (2D, NAPISY PL) ","description":"(15 LAT, 122 MIN)   \"Obcy\" to nowa ekranizacja jednej z najwybitniejszych francuskich powie\u015bci XX wieku autorstwa Alberta Camusa, opublikowanej w 1942 roku.<br><br>Fran\u00e7ois Ozon opowiada histori\u0119 Meursaulta, skromnego, niepozornego urz\u0119dnika, kt\u00f3rego codziennej rutyny nie przerywa nawet \u015bmier\u0107 matki. Do czasu, gdy pewnego gor\u0105cego dnia na pla\u017cy dochodzi do tragicznego zdarzenia. Adaptacja Ozona, kt\u00f3ra mia\u0142a premier\u0119 w Konkursie G\u0142\u00f3wnym festiwalu w Wenecji, to niezwykle aktualna opowie\u015b\u0107 o poszukiwaniu sensu w \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym wszelki sens zosta\u0142 zagubiony. Oszcz\u0119dne dialogi i pi\u0119kne czarno-bia\u0142e zdj\u0119cia, stanowi\u0105ce ho\u0142d dla klasycznego kina, buduj\u0105 wyj\u0105tkow\u0105 atmosfer\u0119 filmu. W rolach g\u0142\u00f3wnych Benjamin Voisin (\"Stracone z\u0142udzenia\", \"Lato \u201885\") oraz Rebecca Marder (\"Moja zbrodnia\").","oryginal_title":"\tL'Etranger","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat","director":"Francois Ozon","organizer":"Francja","country":"Francja","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":122,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789629452.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1472":{"id":1472,"title":"MIRA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/mira-2026-10-16-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789633544.jpg","date":"2026-10-16T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-16 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 10:27:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-16 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":504,"name":"MIRA ","description":"(9 LAT, 85 MIN)   Mira to pogodna 12-latka. Uwielbia tworzy\u0107 ma\u0142e dzie\u0142a sztuki z plastiku z recyklingu. Ca\u0142y czas sp\u0119dza beztrosko z dw\u00f3jk\u0105 swych przyjaci\u00f3\u0142. Lecz wszystko si\u0119 zmienia gdy w jej klasie pojawia si\u0119 nowa, super popularna dziewczyna. Przed Mir\u0105 trudne dylematy - czy powinna porzuci\u0107 plany w\u0142asnej wystawy sztuki i tak jak inne dziewczyny rozmawia\u0107 tylko o zakochiwaniu si\u0119 i mi\u0142o\u015bci? Dorastanie czasem potrafi by\u0107 wielkim wyzwaniem.","oryginal_title":"MIRA","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"Familijny","director":"Marie Limkilde","organizer":"Dania","country":"Dania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":85,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789633544.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1456":{"id":1456,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-16-15-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789630000.jpg","date":"2026-10-16T15:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":120,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-16 14:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 09:29:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-16 15:45:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":120}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":499,"name":"LALKA ","description":"(13 LAT, 162 MIN)   Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.","oryginal_title":"LALKA","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"Polska","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789630000.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1484":{"id":1484,"title":"OASIS: DON'T LOOK BACK IN ANGER (2D, NAPISY PL) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/oasis-don-t-look-back-in-anger-2d-napisy-pl-2026-10-16-18-45","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789642525.jpg","date":"2026-10-16T18:45:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-16 17:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 12:57:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-16 18:45:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":508,"name":"OASIS: DON'T LOOK BACK IN ANGER (2D, NAPISY PL) ","description":"(15 LAT, 124 MIN)   Wraz z reaktywacj\u0105 zespo\u0142u i tras\u0105 \"Oasis Live \u201925\" film przedstawia jego niezwyk\u0142\u0105 drog\u0119 \u2013 od ulic Manchesteru po status \u015bwiatowych gwiazd rocka.","oryginal_title":"Oasis: Don't Look Back in Anger","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"\tdokumentalny\/