:"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":94,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/512\/1789644818.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1494":{"id":1494,"title":"ROZWA\u017bNA I ROMANTYCZNA (2D, NAPISY PL) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/rozwazna-i-romantyczna-2d-napisy-pl-2026-10-31-16-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789645129.jpg","date":"2026-10-31T16:00:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-31 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 13:40:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-31 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":513,"name":"ROZWA\u017bNA I ROMANTYCZNA (2D, NAPISY PL) ","description":"(15 LAT, 132 MIN)   Akcja, osadzona w Anglii epoki georgia\u0144skiej, pod\u0105\u017ca za losami zamo\u017cnego pana Dashwooda, kt\u00f3ry umiera, pozostawiaj\u0105c swoj\u0105 drug\u0105 \u017con\u0119 oraz trzy c\u00f3rki w trudnej sytuacji finansowej. Kobiety przenosz\u0105 si\u0119 do skromnej wiejskiej posiad\u0142o\u015bci, gdzie dwie starsze siostry rywalizuj\u0105 o wzgl\u0119dy r\u00f3\u017cnych adorator\u00f3w, poszukuj\u0105c prawdziwej mi\u0142o\u015bci.","oryginal_title":"Sense and Sensibility","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat","director":"George Oakley","organizer":"USA\/Wlk. Brytania","country":"USA\/Wlk. Brytania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":132,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789645129.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1463":{"id":1463,"title":"CZAS, KT\u00d3RY NIE NADSZED\u0141 ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/czas-ktory-nie-nadszedl-2026-10-31-18-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789631350.jpg","date":"2026-10-31T18:30:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-31 17:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 09:54:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-31 18:30:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":500,"name":"CZAS, KT\u00d3RY NIE NADSZED\u0141 ","description":"(13 LAT, 105 MIN)  W \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym starzenie si\u0119 sta\u0142o si\u0119 najwi\u0119kszym tabu, Sara i Oskar planowali zestarze\u0107 si\u0119 razem. On jednak \u2013 jak wi\u0119kszo\u015b\u0107 \u2013 podda\u0142 si\u0119 rewolucyjnej kuracji antygeriatrycznej, zapewniaj\u0105cej m\u0142odo\u015b\u0107 i miejsce w nowym spo\u0142ecze\u0144stwie. Ona odm\u00f3wi\u0142a, skazuj\u0105c si\u0119 na \u017cycie w zamkni\u0119tym o\u015brodku izolacji. Po latach pr\u00f3ba ucieczki Sary sprawia, \u017ce ponownie si\u0119 spotykaj\u0105. Dzieli ich wygl\u0105d, \u0142\u0105czy brak odpowiedzi na pytania spychane przez lata na drugi plan. Czy uczucia mog\u0105 przetrwa\u0107 czas i nieodwracalne decyzje? Czy mo\u017cna by\u0107 wolnym i \u017cy\u0107 prawdziwie w \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry odmawia prawa do przemijania?","oryginal_title":"CZAS, KT\u00d3RY NIE NADSZED\u0141","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat","director":"\tJulia Rogowska","organizer":"Polska","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":105,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789631350.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1492":{"id":1492,"title":"SUPERMOCNI ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/supermocni-2026-11-01-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/512\/1789644818.jpg","date":"2026-11-01T14:00:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-11-01 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 13:35:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-11-01 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":512,"name":"SUPERMOCNI ","description":"(6 LAT, 94 MIN)   Zo\u015bka jest troch\u0119 zwariowan\u0105 nastolatk\u0105, kt\u00f3ra najbardziej na \u015bwiecie kocha swoje zwierzaki. Gdy pewnego dnia, w naukowym laboratorium jej mamy, dochodzi do ma\u0142ej demolki, a Zo\u015bka i zwierzaki stykaj\u0105 si\u0119 z tajemnicz\u0105 kosmiczn\u0105 substancj\u0105, \u017cycie ca\u0142ej rodziny staje na g\u0142owie! Dziewczynka i jej pupile zaczynaj\u0105 si\u0119 dziwnie zmienia\u0107. Ona staje si\u0119 bardziej dzika i zwinna, a futrzaki bardziej bystre i wygadane. Z jednej strony to \u015bwietna sprawa, bo wszyscy zyskuj\u0105 niesamowite moce, ale z drugiej, je\u015bli tak dalej p\u00f3jdzie, Zo\u015bka ca\u0142kiem zmieni si\u0119 w zwierzaka, a zwierzaki w ludzi. Zosta\u0142 im tylko jeden dzie\u0144 na odwr\u00f3cenie tej dziwnej mutacji. Ale to nie jedyny problem. Ot\u00f3\u017c pewien \u017c\u0105dny w\u0142adzy naukowiec chce za pomoc\u0105 owej kosmicznej substancji przej\u0105\u0107 panowanie nad \u015bwiatem. Je\u015bli wpadnie ona w jego \u0142apy, na ratunek b\u0119dzie za p\u00f3\u017ano. Zo\u015bka i jej zwierzaki musz\u0105 zapanowa\u0107 nad swoimi super mocami i wykorzysta\u0107 je do ratowania planety.","oryginal_title":"Evolution","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animowany","director":"\tZayra Munoz Dominguez, Julio Soto Gurpide","organizer":"Hiszpania","country":"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":94,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/512\/1789644818.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1495":{"id":1495,"title":"ROZWA\u017bNA I ROMANTYCZNA (2D, NAPISY PL) ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/rozwazna-i-romantyczna-2d-napisy-pl-2026-11-01-16-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789645129.jpg","date":"2026-11-01T16:00:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-11-01 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 13:40:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-11-01 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":513,"name":"ROZWA\u017bNA I ROMANTYCZNA (2D, NAPISY PL) ","description":"(15 LAT, 132 MIN)   Akcja, osadzona w Anglii epoki georgia\u0144skiej, pod\u0105\u017ca za losami zamo\u017cnego pana Dashwooda, kt\u00f3ry umiera, pozostawiaj\u0105c swoj\u0105 drug\u0105 \u017con\u0119 oraz trzy c\u00f3rki w trudnej sytuacji finansowej. Kobiety przenosz\u0105 si\u0119 do skromnej wiejskiej posiad\u0142o\u015bci, gdzie dwie starsze siostry rywalizuj\u0105 o wzgl\u0119dy r\u00f3\u017cnych adorator\u00f3w, poszukuj\u0105c prawdziwej mi\u0142o\u015bci.","oryginal_title":"Sense and Sensibility","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat","director":"George Oakley","organizer":"USA\/Wlk. Brytania","country":"USA\/Wlk. Brytania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":132,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789645129.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":2,"name":"Bieszczadzki Dom Kultury","institution_name":"","location_description":"Bez balkonu","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Lesko","city_id":441,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1464":{"id":1464,"title":"CZAS, KT\u00d3RY NIE NADSZED\u0141 ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/czas-ktory-nie-nadszedl-2026-11-01-18-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789631350.jpg","date":"2026-11-01T18:30:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-11-01 17:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 09:54:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-11-01 18:30:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":500,"name":"CZAS, KT\u00d3RY NIE NADSZED\u0141 ","description":"(13 LAT, 105 MIN)  W \u015bwiecie, w kt\u00f3rym starzenie si\u0119 sta\u0142o si\u0119 najwi\u0119kszym tabu, Sara i Oskar planowali zestarze\u0107 si\u0119 razem. On jednak \u2013 jak wi\u0119kszo\u015b\u0107 \u2013 podda\u0142 si\u0119 rewolucyjnej kuracji antygeriatrycznej, zapewniaj\u0105cej m\u0142odo\u015b\u0107 i miejsce w nowym spo\u0142ecze\u0144stwie. Ona odm\u00f3wi\u0142a, skazuj\u0105c si\u0119 na \u017cycie w zamkni\u0119tym o\u015brodku izolacji. Po latach pr\u00f3ba ucieczki Sary sprawia, \u017ce ponownie si\u0119 spotykaj\u0105. Dzieli ich wygl\u0105d, \u0142\u0105czy brak odpowiedzi na pytania spychane przez lata na drugi plan. Czy uczucia mog\u0105 przetrwa\u0107 czas i nieodwracalne decyzje? Czy mo\u017cna by\u0107 wolnym i \u017cy\u0107 prawdziwie w \u015bwiecie, kt\u00f3ry odmawia prawa do przemijania?","oryginal_title":"CZAS, KT\u00d3RY NIE NADSZED\u0141","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat","director":"\tJulia Rogowska","organizer":"Polska","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"o